---
import Icon from "./Icon.astro";

const link = "font-medium text-brand-600 underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-brand-700";
---

<section aria-labelledby="about-convertbrio" class="border-b border-hairline bg-canvas-soft">
  <div class="container-page py-16 sm:py-20">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl">
      <h2 id="about-convertbrio" class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.01em] text-ink sm:text-3xl">
        ConvertBrio: A Free Online Converter for Images, PDFs, and Documents
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-body">
        ConvertBrio is a free <strong class="font-medium text-ink">online file converter</strong> built for anyone who needs a file converted, compressed, or cleaned up without installing software or creating an account. Whether you're changing an image format, shrinking a PDF, or turning a Word document into a polished PDF, upload it from your browser and ConvertBrio's servers handle the conversion in seconds. As a secure file converter, every upload is encrypted in transit and deleted automatically once the job is done, so you can convert files online without worrying about where your data ends up.
      </p>

      <details class="group mt-8">
        <summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center gap-1.5 text-sm font-medium text-brand-600 hover:text-brand-700 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-focus focus-visible:ring-offset-2">
          <span class="group-open:hidden">Read the full guide</span>
          <span class="hidden group-open:inline">Show less</span>
          <Icon name="chevronDown" class="h-4 w-4 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-150 group-open:rotate-180" />
        </summary>

        <div class="mt-2">
        <h3 class="mt-10 text-lg font-semibold text-ink">How to Use ConvertBrio in 3 Simple Steps</h3>
        <ol class="mt-4 flex flex-col gap-4">
          <li class="flex gap-4">
            <span class="flex h-7 w-7 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-canvas-soft-2 text-xs font-semibold text-ink">1</span>
            <p class="leading-relaxed text-body"><strong class="font-medium text-ink">Choose a file.</strong> Drop it into the upload box or browse from your device: no account needed to get started.</p>
          </li>
          <li class="flex gap-4">
            <span class="flex h-7 w-7 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-canvas-soft-2 text-xs font-semibold text-ink">2</span>
            <p class="leading-relaxed text-body"><strong class="font-medium text-ink">Pick a format or setting.</strong> Select an output format with the <a href="/tools/image-converter" class={link}>image converter online</a>, a compression level with the <a href="/tools/compress-image" class={link}>online image compressor</a>, or an operation for any PDF or document converter online tool.</p>
          </li>
          <li class="flex gap-4">
            <span class="flex h-7 w-7 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-canvas-soft-2 text-xs font-semibold text-ink">3</span>
            <p class="leading-relaxed text-body"><strong class="font-medium text-ink">Download your result.</strong> ConvertBrio processes the file instantly and hands you a download link: most conversions finish in a few seconds.</p>
          </li>
        </ol>

        <h3 class="mt-10 text-lg font-semibold text-ink">Convert Image Formats Online</h3>
        <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-body">
          ConvertBrio's image converter online supports every common format, so you can move between them without losing quality.
        </p>

        <div class="mt-6 flex flex-col gap-5">
          <div>
            <h4 class="text-base font-semibold text-ink">AVIF to PNG and AVIF to JPG</h4>
            <p class="mt-1.5 leading-relaxed text-body">
              AVIF is efficient for the web but isn't supported everywhere. Use <a href="/tools/avif-to-png" class={link}>AVIF to PNG</a> for a lossless, widely-compatible image, or <a href="/tools/avif-to-jpg" class={link}>AVIF to JPG</a> for a smaller file that opens in any photo viewer, browser, or design tool.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h4 class="text-base font-semibold text-ink">JPG to PNG and PNG to JPG</h4>
            <p class="mt-1.5 leading-relaxed text-body">
              Need transparency? <a href="/tools/jpg-to-png" class={link}>JPG to PNG</a> adds an alpha channel for logos and graphics. Need a smaller file for the web or email? <a href="/tools/png-to-jpg" class={link}>PNG to JPG</a> compresses flat photos with no visible quality loss.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h4 class="text-base font-semibold text-ink">WEBP to JPG and WEBP to PNG</h4>
            <p class="mt-1.5 leading-relaxed text-body">
              WEBP images from modern websites don't always open in older software. <a href="/tools/webp-to-jpg" class={link}>WEBP to JPG</a> and <a href="/tools/webp-to-png" class={link}>WEBP to PNG</a> convert them into formats every device and app can read.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h4 class="text-base font-semibold text-ink">HEIC Image Conversion</h4>
            <p class="mt-1.5 leading-relaxed text-body">
              iPhone photos save as HEIC by default, which many apps and Windows PCs can't open. <a href="/tools/heic-to-jpg" class={link}>HEIC to JPG</a> converts them instantly, and the general <a href="/tools/image-converter" class={link}>image converter online</a> tool can also export HEIC files as PNG.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <h3 class="mt-10 text-lg font-semibold text-ink">Compress and Resize Images</h3>
        <div class="mt-4 flex flex-col gap-5">
          <div>
            <h4 class="text-base font-semibold text-ink">Reduce an Image Under 100 KB</h4>
            <p class="mt-1.5 leading-relaxed text-body">
              Job applications, government forms, and ID uploads often cap file size at 100 KB. The <a href="/tools/compress-image" class={link}>reduce image to 100 KB</a> tool lets you compress a photo down to that exact limit while keeping it clear enough to pass review.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h4 class="text-base font-semibold text-ink">Image Compression and Resizing</h4>
            <p class="mt-1.5 leading-relaxed text-body">
              Beyond hitting a specific target, ConvertBrio's image size reducer and <a href="/tools/resize-image" class={link}>resize</a> tools let you <a href="/tools/compress-image" class={link}>compress image online</a> for faster page loads, fit exact pixel dimensions, crop to a region, or rotate: all from the same batch image converter workflow.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <h3 class="mt-10 text-lg font-semibold text-ink">PDF Conversion and Document Management</h3>
        <div class="mt-4 flex flex-col gap-5">
          <div>
            <h4 class="text-base font-semibold text-ink">PDF Conversion</h4>
            <p class="mt-1.5 leading-relaxed text-body">
              Turn scanned pages or exported documents into the format you actually need. <a href="/tools/pdf-to-jpg" class={link}>PDF to JPG</a> and <a href="/tools/jpg-to-pdf" class={link}>JPG to PDF</a> move content between images and PDFs, <a href="/tools/merge-pdf" class={link}>merge PDF online</a> combines multiple files into one document, <a href="/tools/split-pdf" class={link}>split PDF online</a> breaks a PDF into individual pages, and <a href="/tools/compress-pdf" class={link}>compress PDF online</a> shrinks file size for email attachments.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h4 class="text-base font-semibold text-ink">Document Conversion</h4>
            <p class="mt-1.5 leading-relaxed text-body">
              For editable text, <a href="/tools/pdf-to-word" class={link}>PDF to Word</a> turns a PDF into an editable DOCX, and <a href="/tools/word-to-pdf" class={link}>Word to PDF</a> locks a finished document into a shareable, print-ready format: both run as a document converter online with no desktop software required.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h4 class="text-base font-semibold text-ink">OCR and Image-to-Text</h4>
            <p class="mt-1.5 leading-relaxed text-body">
              Scanned documents and photographed pages aren't searchable by default. <a href="/tools/ocr-pdf" class={link}>OCR PDF online</a> recognizes the text on each page so you can search, copy, and edit content that used to be locked inside an image: the same technology behind an image to text converter.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <h3 class="mt-10 text-lg font-semibold text-ink">AI Enhancement, Multi-File Tools, and File Privacy</h3>
        <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-body">
          ConvertBrio's AI tools, <a href="/tools/ai-image-enhancer" class={link}>image enhancer</a>, <a href="/tools/ai-upscaler" class={link}>upscaler</a>, and <a href="/tools/remove-background" class={link}>background remover</a>, sharpen, enlarge, and clean up photos automatically. For anyone combining multiple files at once, <a href="/tools/merge-pdf" class={link}>Merge PDF</a>, <a href="/tools/jpg-to-pdf" class={link}>JPG to PDF</a>, and <a href="/tools/merge-documents" class={link}>Merge Documents</a> already accept several files in a single upload, free. And across every tool, file privacy comes standard: uploads are encrypted, processing happens automatically with no human review, and files are deleted from our servers within 24 hours, so ConvertBrio stays a secure file converter you can rely on for sensitive documents.
        </p>
        </div>
      </details>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
